notes.content:
1. Fixed the bug that the moving power might be retained after moving the block by carriage, train or plane;
2. Fixed data errors in the final statistical interface;
3. Fixed some text errors;
4. Fixed possible delays when moving blocks;
5. You can right click on the wonder to display the name of each wonder now;

1. Fixed the incorrect age display caused by using Einstein;
2. Fixed a bug that could get stuck when saving.
3. Make small changes to the icon to make it easier to distinguish between levels;
4. Fixed text display issues;

1. New games now display report when get victory;
2. Fixed the bug of displaying strange numbers when using envoys;
3. Unlocking technologies that different foods or people can merge with will now merge immediately;
4. Changed the number of level 5 resources in normal mode to 6 before, but many players thought it was a bug, so changed it back to 5;
5, the value is slightly adjusted;

1. Fixed the bug that the technology selection stuck sometimes;
2. Fixed the bug that rockets could not be launched if there was no space when winning;
3. Fixed the bug that wagons, trains and aircraft could be used continuously and consume industrial value;
4. Fixed the bug that skill can be stuck if  switching background;
5. Adjusted the probability pool of resource output;
6. The number of Level 5 resources is adjusted;
7.difficult and complex diseases;

1. English  is now supported;
2. Fixed the bug that sometimes unable to choose technology;
3. Fixed the bug that the options did not respond after returning to the main menu;

1. Achievements is availabled!
2. "Advanced Mode" is renamed to "Hero Mode". In Hero Mode, you can select hero in each age to release powerful skills;
3. There are now four game difficulties to choose, with massive adjustments to the values;
4. Fixed the bug that main menu items block each other;
5. Fixed the bug that the new blocks may replace the original blocks;
6. Fixed various bugs;

1. "Envoys" shorten the duration of the war to 6 rounds;

2. "Record" skill cost is 3;

3. Fixed the bug where buff effects were displayed at the front of the menu.

4. Solved the bug that "civil service", "investment" and "mechanization" can be used in non-resource land;

5. Solved the bug that "carriage", "train" and "plane" could be used on immovable land;

6. Accelerated the accumulation speed of food, industry and culture on ui;

1. Fixed the bug of incomplete tutorial display and added advanced mode tutorial;

2. Speed up the increase of cultural value;

3. Fixed the bug that the sound can be heared when the volume was adjusted to the minimum;

4. "Return to the main menu" was added to the Settings menu, and the bug of not saving parameters immediately after adjusting parameters was fixed;

5. No longer quit the game after winning;

6, right click the block can directly display the description;

7. Fixed the bug where moving wonders would make nearby block become wonders.

8. Increased the buff effect after using the skill.
